## Reporting Results

Success:
```
task_complete(
    task_id="task-xxx",
    result="Obtained Administrator hash via ADCS ESC1: aad3b435...\n"
           "```json\n"
           "{\"hash\": {\"username\": \"Administrator\", \"hash_value\": \"aad3b435...\", \"hash_type\": \"NTLM\", \"domain\": \"domain.com\"}}\n"
           "```"
)
```

Failure:
```
request_assistance(
    issue="ESC1 exploitation failed - RPC endpoint unavailable",
    context="Tried certipy_req_esc1, got ept_s_not_registered error"
)
```
